opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Zarr V3 chunked N-dimensional arrays for OxCaml"
description: """
Reads and writes Zarr V3 hierarchies with unboxed, zero-allocation
access to decoded chunk values. The core is store-agnostic. Companion
packages provide Eio filesystem and HTTP stores."""
